Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:48.51,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(823.6,543.6)\fnDFHannotateW7-A\bord2\fs56\c&H171311&\3c&H8B7566&\frz14.73}柜子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:48.51,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1431.4,738.4)\fnDFHannotateW7-A\bord2\fs56\c&H171311&\3c&H8B7566&\frz350.9}床
Comment: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:46.77,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,(电视 衣柜 床)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:48.65,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不要再做了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.36,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,下次再做的话我会要你赔的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:52.54,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:56.03,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那么也没事可做 今天就睡了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:02.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,小里子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:05.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,要来旁边睡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.19,0:23:07.61,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.64,0:23:09.82,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,毕竟这个房间有点冷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.43,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,要是还有空调就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:16.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,抱歉 全都被我变成叶子了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:21.45,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.47,0:23:24.60,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好 木叶小姐晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:32.24,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,木叶小姐很有力气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:33.99,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,能够轻松把我抱起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:35.76,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我也能试试看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:38.62,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没办法 木叶小姐很重呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.72,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好火大哦
